][<SPT><TTL><SUB>Item L9711</SUB>, Table, Autopsy, Stationary-Fixed-Height</TTL><BRK/>
<BRK/>
<TXT>Provide stationary autopsy table on pedestal.  Construct the stationary service center of Type 304 welded and polished No. 4 stainless steel.  
Equip pedestal with mounting flanges.  Provide unit with integrated sink, waste disposer, grid plates and perimeter downdraft.  Factory install 
plumbing and electrical with single point connections.  Provide GFCI duplex receptacle with waterproof cover.  Provide backflow protection.  Provide 
heavy duty 1/2 horsepower with switch.  Sink size approximately:<MET> 356 mm by 305 mm by 203 mm</MET><ENG> 14 inches by 12 inches by 8 inches</ENG> deep with spray 
hose assembly with cold water control valve, nozzle and<MET> 3.05 m</MET><ENG> 10 foot</ENG> of flexible house.  Mixing faucet with gooseneck spout and wrist blades.  
Provide with integral downdraft ventilation.  Provide four grid plates constructed of<MET> 1.27 mm</MET><ENG> 18-gauge</ENG>, Type 304 stainless steel with No. 4 finish, 
perforated and removable.  Overall approximate size:<MET> 813 mm</MET><ENG> 32 inches</ENG> wide by<MET> 2642 mm</MET><ENG> 104 inches</ENG> long by<MET> 889 mm</MET><ENG> 35 inches</ENG> high.</TXT><BRK/>
<BRK/></SPT>
