<BRK/>
<TXT>The stationary service center is equipped with operator work facilities.  Construct of Type 304 welded and polished stainless steel.  Provide unit 
with the legs, feet, sink basin, drainboards and back splash, including water powered vacuum generator with built in vacuum breaker, water service 
