<TXT>Exterior Ramp: Heavy usage roll-in traffic ramp.  It shall provide flush entrance, have non-skid strips and fasten to front of the walk-in floor.  
Ramp shall be as wide as the door and<MET> 660 mm</MET><ENG> 26 inches</ENG> deep minimum.</TXT><BRK/>
